      "number": 1,
      "arab": "بِّسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ إِنَّآ أَنزَلْنَٰهُ فِى لَيْلَةِ ٱلْقَدْرِ",
      "arab_kemenag": "اِنَّآ اَنْزَلْنٰهُ فِيْ لَيْلَةِ الْقَدْرِ ",
      "latin": "Innā anzalnāhu fī lailatil-qadr(i).",
      "translation_id": "Sesungguhnya Kami telah menurunkannya (Al-Qur’an) pada Lailatulqadar.",
      "translation_en": "Indeed, We sent the Qur'an down during the Night of Decree.",
